Frequency shifts 4.31 z under blur vs 0.85 for the core: the absolute-frequency
features are reading the SAMPLING HISTORY, not the soil. That is the mechanism.
Colour shifts 1.54 z under camera change, the largest of the three,
yet section G says removing it changes the score by ~0. A feature can move a lot and
still not be load-bearing once the model is regularised.
