Frequency alone scores LOGO-CV 97.7 against a no-image floor of 82.6 --
it is WORSE than ignoring the images, and it does not beat its own shuffled-label
control. So the honest statement is: the frequency features are near-useless AND
highly fragile. E2's reconnaissance found dom_wavelength the single worst feature
(rho 0.111 against a control of 0.595); this says the whole family is like that.
